<title>UK: LME - warehouse stock movements.</title>
<headline>LME - warehouse stock movements.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Jul 10 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are: copper up 2000, tin up 60, lead up 25, zinc up 650, aluminium down 1975, nickel down 330, aluminium alloy down 280</p>
